## 9. 接口设计

### 9.1 对话查询接口

`POST /chat/query`

**请求**：

```json
{
  "session_id": "s-001",
  "user_id": "u-100",
  "message": "有多少客户健康度是风险",
  "context": {"last_intent": null, "last_slots": {}}
}
```

**响应（澄清）**：

```json
{
  "answer_type": "clarify",
  "intent_code": "health.risk_count",
  "clarify": {
    "rule_id": "CR-02",
    "question": "风险默认含亚健康（综合分<80），统计你权限范围内42家客户。确认？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "确认默认", "value": {"risk_scope": {"include_subhealth": true, "upper_bound": 80}}},
